your judgment.

726
00:42:27.000 --> 00:42:28.279
Excuse me?

727
00:42:28.280 --> 00:42:30.119
Who marries a man she just met?

728
00:42:30.120 --> 00:42:31.439
It's true love!

729
00:42:31.440 --> 00:42:32.679
Whoa!

730
00:42:32.680 --> 00:42:34.291
Whoa. Whoa!

731
00:42:34.320 --> 00:42:35.885
