736
00:42:48.760 --> 00:42:49.961
But I didn't.

737
00:42:56.360 --> 00:42:57.759
Get ready to jump, Sven!

738
00:42:57.760 --> 00:42:59.279
You don't tell him what to do.

739
00:42:59.280 --> 00:43:00.845
